  "body": "    Use meaningful variable names!    Start variable names with a lower case letter and use camelCase.    Variable names are case-sensitive and spelling sensitive! Each use of the variable in the code must match the variable name in the declaration exactly.    Never put variables inside quotes ( \"\" ).     "
