  "body": "  Given the pseudocode for buying a gift above, assume you have $16 to spend. What will be the outcome of the algorithm?      You will buy a gift card, a small cake, some candy, and a birthday card.    Incorrect. You will not have enough money to buy all of these items.      You will buy a small cake and some candy.    You still have a $1 left.      You will buy a small cake, some candy, and a birthday card.    Yep!      You will buy 2 cakes and some candy.    Incorrect. You will not have enough money to buy all of these items.     "
