  "type": "Activity",
  "number": "3.4.1",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  Click on all the lines of code that are part of constructors in the following class.    Constructors are public and have the same name as the class.    public class Name  {   private String first;   private String last;    public Name(String theFirst, String theLast)   {   first = theFirst;   last = theLast;   }    public void setFirst(String theFirst)   {   first = theFirst;   }    public void setLast(String theLast)   {   last = theLast;   }   }   "
