  "id": "createarray",
  "level": "2",
  "url": "topic-4-3-array-basics.html#createarray",
  "type": "Activity",
  "number": "4.3.2",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  Which of the following creates an array of 10 doubles called prices?      int[] prices = new int[10];    We need double for money amounts in prices.      double[] prices = new double[10];    Yes correct!      double[] prices;    This declares the array but does not create it with new.      double[10] prices = new double[];    This is not the correct syntax.     "
