  "body": "  Fix the following code so that it compiles. The code should instantiate an ArrayList of Strings names and fill it with the Strings from the array friends . It should then print out names .    import java.util.*; public class Test1 { public static void main(String[] args) { ArrayList<String> names = new ArrayList<String>(); String[] friends = {\"Sam\", \"Jessica\", \"Mark\", \"Alexis\"}; for (int i = 0; i <= friends.length; i++) { names.add(friends[i]); } System.out.println(names); } }  import static org.junit.Assert.*; import org.junit.*; import java.io.*; public class RunestoneTests extends CodeTestHelper { @Test public void testMain() throws IOException { String output = getMethodOutput(\"main\"); String expect = \"Sam\\nJessica\\nMark\\nAlexis\"; boolean passed = getResults(expect, output, \"Expected output from main\"); assertTrue(passed); } }   "
