  "id": "FRQRouteCipherB_1bMC",
  "level": "2",
  "url": "routeCipher.html#FRQRouteCipherB_1bMC",
  "type": "Activity",
  "number": "4.54.13",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  To solve encryptMessage , you have a message that you need to process and concatenate. What type of loop could you use to solve this problem?      while    Correct!      if    You would need a loop.      for    For this problem, a while loop would be easier to use.      switch statement    You would need a loop.     "
