  "type": "Activity",
  "number": "4.54.16",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  If chunkSize is greater that message.length(), what should you set chunkSize to?      chunkSize = message.substring(chunkSize);    This does not give you the correct result.      chunkSize = += encryptBlock();    This does not give you the correct result.      chunkSize = message.length();    Correct!      chunkSize = fillBlock(message);    This does not give you the correct result.     "
