  "body": "  The following method should recursively return the fibonacci sequence of the first n numbers. The fibonacci (f) of f(0) is 0 and of f(1) is 1. The fibonacci of any other number is f(n-1) + f(n-2). It has one extra block that is not needed in a correct solution.     public int fibonacci(int n)  {    if(n == 0)  {    return 0;    }  else if(n == 1)  {    return 1;    }  else  {    return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);    }  }    return fibonacci(n - 1);    "
