  "body": "  Click on the line or lines that contain the test for the base case    When a base case test is true a value is returned and the recursion stops    public static void mystery (int x) {   System.out.print(x % 10);   if ((x \/ 10) == 0)   {   System.out.print(x % 10);   return;   }   else   {   mystery(x \/ 10);   }   System.out.print(x % 10);  }   "
