  "title": "",
  "body": "  How many times would the body of this nested for loop execute?   for (int row = 7; row < 17; row++) for (int col = 6; col < 15; col++)       17    Don't forget the inner loop.      17 - 7 = 10    Don't forget the inner loop.      (17 - 7) * (15 - 6) = 90    Correct      17 * 15 = 255    The loops do not start at 0.     "
