  "body": "  Consider the method mystery . What is returned as a result of mystery(4) ?   public int mystery (int num) { if (num == 1) return 3; else return 3 * mystery (num - 1); }       12    This would be correct if the recursive method called 3 + mystery (num - 1). Check the recursive call and try again.      243    This method calculates 3 ^ num. 3 ^ 4 is not equal to 243, so check your tracing and try again.      81    This method calculates 3 ^ num. It goes through the recursive calls until num reaches 1, then 3 is multiplied by itself (num) times. The method has been called four times, and 3 ^ 4 is 81.      15    This would be correct if the recursive method called 3 + mystery (num - 1), and num was equal to 5. Check the base case and the parameter and try again.      27    This method calculates 3 ^ num. 3 ^ 4 is not equal to 27, so check your tracing and try again.     "
