  "body": "  Write code that calculates and prints how many chicken wings you can buy with $3.50 if the wings are $.60 each. Make sure your answer is an integer.    public class Test1 { public static void main(String[] args) { \/\/ Add your code here } }  \/\/ ch3ex8muc import static org.junit.Assert.*; import org.junit.*; import java.io.*; public class RunestoneTests extends CodeTestHelper { public RunestoneTests() { super(\"Test1\"); } @Test public void test1() { String output = getMethodOutput(\"main\"); String expect = \"5\"; boolean passed = getResults(expect, output, \"Running main\"); assertTrue(passed); } @Test public void test2() { String output = getMethodOutput(\"main\"); String expect = \"5\"; boolean passed = !output.contains(\".\"); passed = getResults(expect, output, \"Checking for integer output\", passed); assertTrue(passed); } }   "
